{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19118","headline":"和苏十郎中谢病闲居时严常侍萧给事同过访叹初有二毛之作 · 刘禹锡","name":"和苏十郎中谢病闲居时严常侍萧给事同过访叹初有二毛之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清羸隐几望云空，左掖鸳鸾到室中。\n一卷素书消永日，数茎斑髪对秋风。\n菱花照後容虽改，蓍草占来命已通。\n莫怪人人惊早白，缘君尚是黑头翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}